{"set":"omni","app":"salesiq","obj":"brand","op":"update-existing","msg":"Pick any existing brand in Omnichannel (not one starting with QA TIA CRUD) and change its name by adding \" (edited)\" at the end.","conv":"cc6c35f6-fb50-51e6-a2bf-c16c1f8ed6fc","status":200,"err":null,"card":null,"summary":null,"lines":null,"text":"There is no module named 'brands' accessible in Omnichannel for me to pick an existing brand and prepare a name change card. You may want to check with your admin if the brands module is available or if you have permission to access it. || FOLLOW-UP: There is no accessible module named 'brands' in Omnichannel for me to pick an existing brand and prepare a name change card. Please check with your admin if the brands module is available or if you have permission to access it.","at":"2026-11-25T10:50:58"}
