{"set":"omni","app":"salesiq","obj":"department–brand link","op":"create","msg":"Create a new department–brand link named \"QA TIA CRUD department–brand link\". Keep it inactive / not active, and if it needs criteria, apply it only to records whose name starts with \"QA TIA CRUD\".","conv":"1cc1dffb-56b5-5a5e-9e2f-6168ea86c6fe","status":200,"err":null,"card":null,"summary":null,"lines":null,"text":"Linking a department to a brand cannot be created or changed by me because it affects brand admins' management rights. You can create and manage department–brand links yourself in Settings > Departments. Please go there to create the \"QA TIA CRUD department–brand link\" and set it inactive with the criteria you want.","at":"2026-11-25T10:51:46"}
